{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_16\">Problem 16</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 16\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of three numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/1/73119f04d6ae5f6eb4afc8c9c946a5744a11be50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The ratio of the first to the second is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77c775ff741cb365eb352e540ffa8948fa79b753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, \nand the ratio of the second to the third is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/1/9c1e6ee91caa58967c84ade146d2c8f44734549e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {5}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />. The second number is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/1/941bc851dec136cf6f47b226d1f250838a271229.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 15 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 30 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 32 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 33$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8acfd7d5ee559262593701b8dbd02e43ad96e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"13\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b1d6265e67657b5886ce257671d45ff9c0282eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"12\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. We see that \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/9/a19e174a2a977a30668dae420893fae94ac3ca77.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+b+c = 98\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"14\" />\nand \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/f/86ff42e081fc9cb125c59ae0f7e7b97a611a7372.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{b} = \\frac{2}{3} \\Rrightarrow 3a = 2b\\]\" width=\"137\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/31371e78ea1eabe0bcae23ba5361493f9eb76102.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{b}{c} = \\frac{5}{8} \\Rrightarrow 8b = 5c\\]\" width=\"133\" height=\"37\" />\nWriting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/4/cc4c88d53549bfd5acb78f1541f266d3adadafdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{2}{3} b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfd0612018030774b2ab99c27f61c233a6b57e1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{8}{5} b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"37\" />. \nSubstituting in the sum, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2ea3357eda2600e331064430f70094432acdf7a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2}{3} b + b + \\frac{8}{5} b = 98\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f4108342884665c2b91b4ba224902ed450bec928.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{49}{15} b = 98\\]\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/c/d6c05997150a8b5c6aad1e28afa15274b743c759.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = 98 \\cdot \\frac{15}{49} \\Rrightarrow b = 30\\]\" width=\"162\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>~JustinLee2017\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.arto